ns out. The top level keeps only its cheapest plan, because the query has no ORDER BY or GROUP BY, which is why 230, in DNO order, is struck. Appendix slides 80 and 81 have every one of the 30 costs. Sort cost is our own one-pass estimate at 20 rows per page. \n Source: §5, Figure 6. https://doi.org/10.1145/582095.582099"
